# Deploy

Production activation builds on the native builder and `nix copy`s the
closure with `deploy-rs`, then `switch-to-configuration`. `x86_64-linux`
builds on `proxmox-dev`. Hosts substitute from `cache.nixos.org`. Facts,
make targets, CI vs local, and the script index: `docs/deployments.md`.

## Where it runs

Edits land on the Darwin checkout. **x86_64 deploys run on
`root@proxmox-dev`.**

Do not `make deploy` from the laptop store or from `gaming`.

`proxmox-dev` has no deploy identity. Hop to targets with the operator
agent: `ssh -A root@proxmox-dev`. Plain `ssh` cannot `nix copy` or switch
remote hosts. Heredoc: `docs/deployments.md`.

`gaming` is a production deploy target (`make deploy-gaming`). `make
reboot-all` skips it. GitLab does not deploy
(`docs/adr/2026-11-05-ci-lint-only.md`).

`fleet.inventory.deployPausedHosts` is empty after the NixOS Proxmox
guests were destroyed. Do not recreate VMs 101–103 or 106.

## Scope

Docs-only: no deploy. Observability (Prometheus, Loki, Grafana, ntfy):
`proxmox-observability-debian` only. Edge Caddy / Keycloak `/admin` CIDR:
`xcloud-caddy`. Do not `make deploy` the fleet for one service.

## After switch

`restartIfChanged = false` on Grafana, Loki, ntfy, and similar. A
successful switch can leave the old process on the old config. Restart the
unit you changed and read the journal for `error parsing config` / exit 1
before calling it done.

`nixos-rebuild --rollback` fails (`nixos-config` is not on `NIX_PATH`). Use
`/nix/var/nix/profiles/system-N-link/bin/switch-to-configuration switch`
(`docs/runbooks/rollback.md`). `deploy-rs` `magicRollback` reverts a
failed confirmation on the production path.

## Operator copy (x86)

```bash
rsync -az --delete --exclude='.git/' --exclude='result' --exclude='.direnv/' \
  /Users/alex/code/nixos-fleet/ root@proxmox-dev:/root/nixos-fleet-deploy/
```

On proxmox-dev, `./scripts/deploy-host.sh <host>`. Open that session with
`ssh -A`. Full heredoc: `docs/deployments.md`. The script passes
`cache.nixos.org` on the CLI so the first switch works while `nix.conf`
still names Attic.
